[[2047,15,16384,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The control unit of the AISIN electronic\nautomatic transmission \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              monitors and governs the entire\nautomatic transmission management system.</p><p>The control unit is supplied directly by\nthe battery via the line of maxifuse O/A located on the battery\n(connector \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99 D</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ),at pin 12 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply controlled by the ignition (15/54)\nreaches pin 25 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Pins 2 and 8 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               are\nearthed.</p><p>The control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is connected\nto the selector lever position sensor located on the gearbox (unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ,\nconnector A): the unit receives an ignition-controlled supply (15/54)\nat pin 9, while pin 10 is earthed.</p><p>Pins 3, 5, 8 and 11 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               connector\nA send the signals corresponding to P, D, N and R respectively,\nwhich are connected to control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , at pins 3 and 16\nof connector A and 7 and 16 of connector B.</p><p>Pins 1 and 4 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               connector A are\nconnected to the reverse gear sensor, and they send signals to turn\non the reversing light (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3233866\">E2022</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><p>Pin 2 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               connector A gives a\nsafety signal (gear in N or P) for the starting enablement relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J05</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which\ngives the starting enablement: pin 50 of the starter motor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>A20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (\n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234399\">E5010</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><p>The control unit M55 - connector A - also connects to the solenoid unit L50 - connector B - which contains the control valves, pressure regulator and some sensors:</p><ul><li>the solenoid control signals come from pin 13 (for the\ngear change solenoid <strong>L1</strong> ), pin 26 (for the gear change solenoid <strong>L2</strong> ), pin 26 (for the torque converter lock solenoid L-UP)\nand pin 15 (for solenoid E/B);</li><li>pin 11 of connector A of <strong>M55</strong> supplies the pressure\ncontrol solenoid, whose control signal comes from pin 1 of connector\nA of <strong>M55</strong> ;</li><li>pins 5 and 18 of connector A of <strong>M55</strong> connect to\nthe oil temperature sensor located next to the solenoids in <strong>L50</strong> .</li></ul><p>Pins 4  and 12 of connector B \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               are\nconnected to the car speed sensor (gearbox output) \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K77</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Pins 4  and 12 of connector B \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               are\nconnected to the car speed sensor (gearbox output) \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K77</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Pins 3 and 11 of connector B \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               are\nconnected to the gearbox speed input sensor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K78</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; pin 2 of\nconnector B \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               provides  the signal screening earth.</p><p>Pin 9 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               receives\nthe signal coming from the brake lights switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , with\nthe supply controlled by the ignition (INT) from fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3233830\">E2021</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).This\nsignal controls the locking of the torque converter (L-UP).</p><p>The gear controls assembly \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H37</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               receives\nan ignition-controlled supply (15/54) and is connected to the control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               to indicate the gear engagement request: these signals\nare sent to pins 13, 8, 10, 15 and 14 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ;\n pin 7 of the connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               receives the P engaged signal.</p><p>The selector\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H49</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              is for selecting\nthe various operating modes;  it receives an ignition-controlled\nsupply (15/54) and is connected to control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               at pin 5\nof connector  B (SPORT/CITY function) and pin 14 of connector B\n(ICE function).</p><p>Control unit M55 governs a series of safety checks:</p><ul><li>shift lock (lever locked if ignition is not on (MAR) and\nbrake pressed): sends a signal from pin 21 of connector A to the\nspeed control unit <strong>H37</strong> ;</li><li>key lock (key locked if the gear selector is not set to\nP): sends a signal from pin 20 of connector A which controls the\nlock electromagnet <strong>L55</strong> built into the ignition switch;</li><li>doors open buzzer: the signal that the driver&#x27;s door is\nopen - lock <strong>N50</strong>  reaches pin 6 of connector A of <strong>M55</strong> ;\nthe command for the buzzer, located in the instrument <strong>E15</strong> ,\nis sent from pin 10 of connector A; the same line also sends signals\nfor the display and for the &quot;automatic transmission fault&quot; warning\nlight.</li><li>oil overheating: if the gearbox oil is overheating (detected\nby the sensor in the above-mentioned unit <strong>L50</strong> , a command\nis issued from pin 19 of connector A to the specific relay <strong>J86</strong> ,\nsupplied under ignition control (15/54) via the line protected by\nthe fuse <strong>F4</strong> located in unit <strong>B98 A,</strong> which controls\nthe appropriate fan <strong>N49</strong> .</li></ul><p>Control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is equipped with\na self-test system that may be used by connecting the unit to connector \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : this receives signals from pin 23 connector A of control\nunit\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is connected to\nthe engine management control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . This connection is\nvia the CAN line from pins 1 and 9 of connector B of  \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , to\npins 11 and 12 of connector D of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]